<div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Terminal Web</h1><p>Ejecuta comandos en el sistema de forma segura</p></div></div>
<article class="panel terminal-panel standalone-terminal"><div class="terminal-window large-terminal"><div class="terminal-output" id="terminalOutput">LinuxCore Web Terminal [versión demostrativa]<br>Esta terminal simula algunos comandos comunes. No ejecuta comandos reales del servidor.<br>Escribe <b>help</b> para ver los comandos disponibles.<br><span class="terminal-prompt">admin@linuxcore:~$</span></div><form id="terminalForm" class="terminal-form"><span>admin@linuxcore:~$</span><input id="terminalCommand" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Comando"><button type="submit" aria-label="Ejecutar"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></button></form></div></article>
<div class="terminal-hints"><button class="command-chip" data-command="help">help</button><button class="command-chip" data-command="ls">ls</button><button class="command-chip" data-command="whoami">whoami</button><button class="command-chip" data-command="date">date</button><button class="command-chip" data-command="free -h">free -h</button><button class="command-chip" data-command="df -h">df -h</button></div>
